(6571889, 978477, 59029, '<td valign="top">I was mean this time and gave you *only* an 8, cause I knew I''d see it on the homepage.  Well done and once again the staggering amount of work you put into your setups and lighting just leave me flabbergasted.  Where on earth do you find the time?!<br/> <br/>btw all you need now is to get a red in a challenge ending this week and you''ll have an <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/17203.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/17203.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/17203.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=17203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">scalvert</a> trifecta :-)</td>', 'I was mean this time and gave you *only* an 8, cause I knew I''d see it on the homepage.  Well done and once again the staggering amount of work you put into your setups and lighting just leave me flabbergasted.  Where on earth do you find the time?! btw all you need now is to get a red in a challenge ending this week and you''ll have an  scalvert trifecta :-)', '2011-10-19 18:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6571907, 978495, 60495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> wow.... My first reaction as "I want to drive that bridge!!" My next reaction was: "there''s no way I want to drive that bridge!!"</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The bridge is not bad, the Tram that goes over the gorge was  a little intimidating, you are slightly higher and hanging from a thin wire. I asked how long will it take to hit the ground if it fell, the operator said 8 seconds, the people riding with us were not all that excited I asked the question....lol<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-10-19 18:26:54.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: wow.... My first reaction as "I want to drive that bridge!!" My next reaction was: "there''s no way I want to drive that bridge!!"  The bridge is not bad, the Tram that goes over the gorge was  a little intimidating, you are slightly higher and hanging from a thin wire. I asked how long will it take to hit the ground if it fell, the operator said 8 seconds, the people riding with us were not all that excited I asked the question....lol', '2011-10-19 19:23:21.000000', '2011-10-19 19:26:54.000000', 0),
