(6571945, 978495, 49337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PapaBob:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> wow.... My first reaction as "I want to drive that bridge!!" My next reaction was: "there''s no way I want to drive that bridge!!"</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The bridge is not bad, the Tram that goes over the gorge was  a little intimidating, you are slightly higher and hanging from a thin wire. I asked how long will it take to hit the ground if it fell, the operator said 8 seconds, the people riding with us were not all that excited I asked the question....lol </i></td></tr></table> <br/>should have asked how many seconds it takes to reach terminal velocity directly after he answered the first question.....<br/> <br/>ooh and congrats!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-10-19 20:01:30.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by PapaBob: Originally posted by vawendy: wow.... My first reaction as "I want to drive that bridge!!" My next reaction was: "there''s no way I want to drive that bridge!!"  The bridge is not bad, the Tram that goes over the gorge was  a little intimidating, you are slightly higher and hanging from a thin wire. I asked how long will it take to hit the ground if it fell, the operator said 8 seconds, the people riding with us were not all that excited I asked the question....lol  should have asked how many seconds it takes to reach terminal velocity directly after he answered the first question..... ooh and congrats!!', '2011-10-19 21:01:10.000000', '2011-10-19 21:01:30.000000', 0),
